abstract: >-
  AzSentBench is a multi-domain sentiment benchmark for Azerbaijani with a
  leakage-audited, verifiable evaluation split: 271,278 user comments from
  five domains and a 10,000-item gold partition whose 3,000-item test set
  carries three annotations and an adjudicated label per comment (1,743
  annotated blind, 1,257 verified with an earlier label visible). The release provides comment identifiers,
  labels, per-annotator records, the fixed split, the regeneration tooling,
  the experimental pipeline, the leakage-audit code and the stored results of
  more than six hundred training runs. The comment text is not redistributed; it is shared for
  non-commercial research on request.
